  "0 表示每個 key 一樣常被讀；1 左右表示少數 key 非常熱門（熱點）。值越大，快取命中率越高，但熱門 key 所在的分片越忙。": "0 means every key is read equally often; about 1 means a few keys are very hot (hot spots). A higher value gives a higher cache hit rate, but the shard that holds the hot keys gets busier.",
  "1 人，一週上線。每秒 4000 個請求，95% 是讀取。現在的資料庫撐不住，一成以上的請求失敗。整場失敗率 ≤ 1%、p99 ≤ 200 ms，每月不超過 $2,800，複雜度不超過 6 點：一個人顧不了讀副本。": "1 person, one week to launch. 4000 requests per second, 95% reads. The database cannot keep up now, and more than 10% of requests fail. Error rate ≤ 1% and p99 ≤ 200 ms for the whole run, at most $2,800 a month, at most 6 complexity points: one person cannot look after read replicas.",
