  "2 人團隊，兩週。做一個查地址的 API：把地址換成座標。座標由外部的地圖供應商算，它已經在畫布上。它每 20 次會失敗 1 次。": "A team of 2, two weeks. Build an address lookup API: an address in, coordinates out. An outside map provider finds the coordinates; it is on the canvas already. It fails 1 time in 20.",
  "2 人團隊，兩週。每秒 600 個請求，第 20 秒起有 10 秒變成 3 倍；每一跳都重試 3 次，系統被重試塞爆，之後也沒有恢復。整場失敗率 ≤ 1%、p99 ≤ 300 ms，每月不超過 $850，複雜度不超過 7 點。": "A team of 2, two weeks. 600 requests per second, 3× for 10 s from 20 s; every hop retries 3 times, the retries choke the system, and it does not recover. Error rate ≤ 1% and p99 ≤ 300 ms for the whole run, at most $850 a month, at most 7 complexity points.",
  "3 人團隊，一個月。做商店的後端：看商品和結帳。結帳要呼叫外部的金流供應商，它已經在畫布上。它每天總有一段時間很慢。": "A team of 3, one month. Build the back end of a shop: view products and check out. Checkout calls an outside payment provider; it is on the canvas already. Every day it is very slow for a while.",
  "3 人團隊，一個月。平常每秒 300 個請求；第 2 分鐘起有 2 分鐘變成 3 倍。目前固定 2 台 API Server，尖峰時大量失敗。整場失敗率 ≤ 1%、p99 ≤ 500 ms，每月不超過 $800，複雜度不超過 6 點。": "A team of 3, one month. 300 requests per second normally; 3× for 2 minutes from minute 2. Now there are 2 fixed API Server instances, and many requests fail at the peak. Error rate ≤ 1% and p99 ≤ 500 ms for the whole run, at most $800 a month, at most 6 complexity points.",
  "3 人團隊，兩個月後有一檔限量開賣。平常流量不大，開賣的 15 秒會暴增。訂單要寫進公司共用的資料庫，它已經在畫布上。": "A team of 3, a limited sale in two months. Traffic is low most of the time and jumps for the 15 seconds of the sale. Orders go into the company's shared database; it is on the canvas already.",
  "30 分鐘的情境約 6 秒播完": "A 30-minute scenario plays in about 6 seconds",
