  "API 直接呼叫供應商，每個請求就要等 200 ms，不可能在 100 ms 內回應。把「收下請求」和「送出簡訊」分開：API 把請求放進佇列就回應，背景工作再去呼叫供應商。每秒 500 則 × 200 ms = 同時有 100 則在送，背景工作的同時處理數加起來要超過 100。": "If the API calls the provider directly, each request waits 200 ms, so it cannot answer in 100 ms. Separate \"accept the request\" from \"send the message\": the API puts the request on a queue and answers, and workers call the provider. 500 a second × 200 ms = 100 messages in flight at a time, so the workers' concurrency must add up to more than 100.",
