  "LinkedIn 風格：Feed 的重試死亡螺旋（2018 負載測試）": "LinkedIn style: the feed's retry death spiral (2018 load test)",
  "MIT 授權。範例是簡化的模型，不是任何公司真正的架構。": "MIT license. The examples are simplified models, not any company's real architecture.",
  "MySQL 叢集（orchestrator 管理）": "MySQL cluster (managed by orchestrator)",
  "Netflix 2016 年的大致架構。影片串流幾乎都由 Open Connect 送出：Netflix 把快取機器放進各地 ISP 的機房，離峰時從 AWS 的母檔填充。瀏覽、登入、播放前的 API 呼叫才進 AWS：每個區域的 Zuul 是所有裝置請求的前門（路由、認證、限流），後面是幾百個微服務。服務大多是無狀態的，狀態放在快取或資料庫：EVCache（以 memcached 為基礎）擋在 Cassandra 等資料庫前面，存觀看紀錄、評分、推薦。不是必要的依賴（例如推薦）用 Hystrix 包起來，失敗時回預設清單。Netflix 跑在三個 AWS 區域，任何區域都能服務任何會員；Chaos Kong 演練會把整個區域的流量切到別區。原文提到，沒有跨區複製的話，流量切過去會遇到冷快取，大量沒命中會壓垮資料庫，所以 EVCache 用 Kafka 做跨區複製。來源：https://netflixtechblog.com/caching-for-a-global-netflix-7bcc457012f1 、https://github.com/Netflix/zuul/wiki 、https://github.com/Netflix/Hystrix/wiki 、https://openconnect.netflix.com/ 。參數是教學用的縮小值，不是 Netflix 的實際數字。": "The approximate architecture of Netflix in 2016. Almost all video streaming comes from Open Connect: Netflix puts cache servers in ISP data centers around the world and fills them from the source files in AWS during off-peak hours. Only browsing, sign-in and the API calls before playback go to AWS: in each region, Zuul is the front door for all device requests (routing, authentication, rate limiting), with hundreds of microservices behind it. Most services are stateless and keep state in caches or databases: EVCache (based on memcached) sits in front of Cassandra and other databases and holds viewing history, ratings and recommendations. Dependencies that are not required (for example, recommendations) are wrapped in Hystrix, which returns a default list when they fail. Netflix runs in three AWS regions, and any region can serve any member; Chaos Kong exercises move all traffic of a region to the others. The source says that without cross-region replication, the moved traffic hits cold caches and the many misses overload the databases, so EVCache replicates across regions with Kafka. Sources: https://netflixtechblog.com/caching-for-a-global-netflix-7bcc457012f1 , https://github.com/Netflix/zuul/wiki , https://github.com/Netflix/Hystrix/wiki , https://openconnect.netflix.com/ . The parameters are small values for teaching, not Netflix's real numbers.",
  "Netflix 2016：兩個區域、Zuul、EVCache、Hystrix、Open Connect": "Netflix 2016: two regions, Zuul, EVCache, Hystrix, Open Connect",
  "Netflix 把影片事先放到 ISP 機房裡的 Open Connect 快取設備，播放時大部分位元組不必回到 AWS。這個模型把 CDN 放在最前面，沒命中才回到來源服務和物件儲存。重點是：CDN 命中率決定來源要扛多少，流量突波主要落在 CDN 上。": "Netflix puts videos ahead of time on Open Connect cache appliances inside ISP sites, so most bytes of a stream never go back to AWS. This model puts the CDN first; only a miss goes back to the origin service and object storage. The point: CDN hit rate decides how much the origin must carry, and traffic spikes land mostly on the CDN.",
  "OK（{n} 個提醒）": "OK ({n} warnings)",
