  "下一個": "Next",
  "下單 API": "Order API",
  "下單時 API 先把訂單寫進資料庫，再送一則「訂單成立」訊息到佇列，給出貨 worker 處理。兩件事是分開的呼叫：情境在第 20 秒讓佇列故障 20 秒，這段時間訂單照樣存進資料庫，訊息卻送不出去（看 API 的「資料和訊息不一致」）：使用者看到失敗、重新下單，出貨那邊永遠不知道第一張訂單。試試看：把 API 的「寫入後送訊息」改成「開（transactional outbox）」：訊息和訂單在同一筆交易寫進資料庫，由 relay 慢慢送到佇列，佇列恢復後全部補送；使用者不再看到失敗，也不必等佇列。": "An order is first written to the database, then an \"order placed\" message goes to a queue for the shipping worker. These are two separate calls: at 20 s the queue goes down for 20 s. Orders are still saved, but their messages cannot be sent (see the API's \"Data and message disagree\"): the user sees an error and orders again, and shipping never hears about the first order. Try this: set the API's \"Message after write\" to \"On (transactional outbox)\": the message is written in the same transaction as the order, and a relay sends it to the queue, catching up after the queue is back. Users no longer see errors and do not wait for the queue.",
  "下游最忙的是{name}（最忙時 {peak}）。": "The busiest downstream is {name} (peak {peak}).",
  "下游沒有很忙，但回應慢（例如變慢、逾時或重試）。": "Downstream is not very busy, but it responds slowly (for example slow, timeout or retry).",
