  "不能匯入 {file}：這不是 JSON。要匯入的是 terraform show -json 輸出的 plan JSON。": "Cannot import {file}: this is not JSON. Import the plan JSON that terraform show -json writes.",
  "不能匯入 {file}：這是 Terraform 原始檔（.tf）。先執行 terraform plan -out plan.out，再執行 terraform show -json plan.out > plan.json，然後匯入 plan.json。": "Cannot import {file}: this is a Terraform source file (.tf). Run terraform plan -out plan.out, then terraform show -json plan.out > plan.json, and import plan.json.",
  "不能寫入剪貼簿：連結已放在網址列，從那裡複製。": "Cannot write to the clipboard: the link is in the address bar, copy it from there.",
  "不要對快取重試：把 API → 快取的重試設成 0 次。快取拿不到就當作沒命中，直接讀資料庫，資料庫撐得住。": "Do not retry the cache: set the retries of API → cache to 0. When the cache does not answer, treat it as a miss and read the database. The database can take it.",
  "不計（寫入互不等待）": "Off (writes never wait for each other)",
