  "中繼資料庫": "Metadata database",
  "主動健康檢查": "Active health checks",
  "主庫": "Primary",
  "主庫之外的唯讀副本。讀取可以分給副本，寫入只到主庫。": "A read-only replica outside the primary. Reads can go to replicas; writes only go to the primary.",
  "主庫和副本輪流": "Round-robin primary and replica",
  "主庫寫完後，要多久才把這筆寫入送到副本（網路、批次傳送）。這段時間加上副本排隊和套用的時間，就是複製延遲（replication lag）。在這段時間讀副本，會讀到舊資料。": "After the primary writes, how long the write takes to reach a replica (network, batched sends). This time plus the replica queue and apply time is the replication lag. Reading a replica during this window gives a stale read.",
  "主庫已回覆成功、但新主庫沒收到的寫入（非同步複製）": "Writes the primary acknowledged that the new primary never received (asynchronous replication)",
  "主庫故障到副本接手要多久：偵測、確認、選新主庫、改連線。這段時間寫入全部失敗。RDS Multi-AZ 執行個體約 60–120 秒；Multi-AZ cluster 約 20–35 秒。": "How long from a primary failure until a replica takes over: detect, confirm, pick the new primary, reconnect. All writes fail in that time. RDS Multi-AZ instances take about 60–120 seconds; Multi-AZ clusters about 20–35 seconds.",
  "主庫故障後，把最跟得上的副本升為主庫。複製是非同步的：主庫已經回覆成功、但還沒送到這個副本的寫入，就遺失了。需要讀副本，而且「副本套用寫入成本」大於 0（才追蹤複製進度）。": "When the primary fails, the replica that is furthest along becomes the primary. Replication is asynchronous: writes the primary acknowledged but had not sent to this replica yet are lost. Needs read replicas and a replica apply cost above 0 (to track replication).",
  "主庫每寫一次，每個副本也要花「寫入時間 × 這個比例」套用它。所以副本救不了寫入量。0 表示不計（也不計算讀到舊資料）。": "For each write to the primary, every replica also spends \"write time × this ratio\" applying it. So replicas cannot save write volume. 0 means not counted (and stale reads are not computed).",
  "主庫＋{r} 副本 · {c} 連線": "Primary + {r} replicas · {c} connections",
