  "估計：沒有設節流，前面的限流用帳號預設 {rps} rps（帳號配額可能調過）。": "Estimate: no throttling is set, so the throttle in front uses the account default {rps} rps (the account quota may have been raised).",
  "估計：沒有設預留併發，併發上限用帳號預設 {n}（帳號配額可能調過）。": "Estimate: no reserved concurrency, so the concurrency limit is the account default {n} (the account quota may have been raised).",
  "估計：讀取走 reader endpoint（讀副本）；程式實際用哪個 endpoint 讀不到。": "Estimate: reads go to the reader endpoint (the replicas); which endpoint the code really uses cannot be read.",
