  "併入 API Gateway：讀節流、整合逾時和後端。": "Folded into API Gateway: throttling, integration timeouts and backends are read from it.",
  "併入 Aurora 叢集：執行個體數變成副本數。": "Folded into the Aurora cluster: the number of instances becomes the replica count.",
  "併入 Auto Scaling group：讀機型和 user_data。": "Folded into the Auto Scaling group: the instance type and user_data are read from it.",
  "併入 DNS：健康檢查變成偵測故障的時間。": "Folded into DNS: the health check becomes the failure detection time.",
