  "併入佇列：讀 DLQ 的 maxReceiveCount。": "Folded into the queue: the maxReceiveCount of its DLQ is read from it.",
  "併入其他元件或略過": "Folded into other components or skipped",
  "併入函式：event source mapping 變成佇列到函式的線和併發上限。": "Folded into the function: the event source mapping becomes the queue-to-function line and a concurrency limit.",
  "併入函式：讀預留併發、非同步呼叫設定。": "Folded into the function: reserved concurrency and asynchronous invocation settings are read from it.",
  "併入服務：讀 CPU、記憶體和環境變數。": "Folded into the service: CPU, memory and environment variables are read from it.",
  "併入服務：變成台數上下限和目標忙碌率。": "Folded into the service: it gives the min and max instances and the target utilization.",
  "併入負載平衡器：健康檢查和分流方式從這裡讀。": "Folded into the load balancer: the health check and the routing policy are read from it.",
  "併入負載平衡器：用來找出後面的 target group。": "Folded into the load balancer: used to find the target groups behind it.",
  "併入資料庫：RDS Proxy 的連線上限給檢查 C1 用。": "Folded into the database: the RDS Proxy connection limit is used by check C1.",
  "併入資料庫：讀 max_connections。": "Folded into the database: max_connections is read from it.",
