  "使用率（每台）": "Utilisation (each instance)",
  "使用者": "Users",
  "使用者剛寫入就讀，讀到還沒複製過去的副本，會看不到自己的寫入（read-your-writes 失敗）。開啟時，寫入後「視窗」內的讀取送到主庫。代價：主庫讀取變多。": "A user who reads right after writing, from a replica that has not received the write yet, does not see their own write (read-your-writes fails). When on, reads within the window after a write go to the primary. Cost: more reads on the primary.",
  "使用者填": "Yours",
  "使用者寫入後馬上讀，讀到的副本還沒套用那筆寫入（read-your-writes 失敗）": "The user read right after writing, and the replica had not applied that write yet (read-your-writes failed)",
  "使用者放棄時間": "User gives up after",
  "使用者看到的 p99": "p99 that users see",
  "使用者看到的失敗率": "Error rate that users see",
  "使用者經過 API 閘道和負載平衡器到 8 台 API 伺服器。情境在第 20 秒部署一份壞設定：新版本有 60% 的請求出錯，而且一次推到全部閘道和伺服器（像 2019 年 Cloudflare 的 WAF 規則、2025 年的設定檔推送）。全站一起壞，直到跑完。試試看：在情境裡把「部署新版本」改成 4 波、每波觀察 10 秒，打開「自動回滾門檻」5%。第一波只更新四分之一的機器，觀察期發現失敗就自動回滾：受影響的只有第一波那 10 秒的一小部分請求（爆炸半徑小）。": "Users go through an API gateway and a load balancer to 8 API servers. At 20 s the scenario deploys a bad config: the new version fails 60% of its requests, and it goes to every gateway and server at once (like Cloudflare's WAF rule in 2019 and its config file push in 2025). The whole site fails together until the end. Try this: in the scenario, set \"Deploy a new version\" to 4 waves, 10 s of watching per wave, and turn on \"Automatic rollback threshold\" at 5%. The first wave updates only a quarter of the machines, and the check rolls it back when it sees failures: only a small share of the requests in those first 10 s are hit (a small blast radius).",
  "使用者能下單；下了單就不能掉": "Users can place an order; a placed order must not be lost",
  "使用者能把一個長網址換成短網址": "Users can turn a long URL into a short one",
  "使用者能看到商品的庫存": "Users can see the stock of a product",
  "使用者能看商品": "Users can view products",
  "使用者能結帳：呼叫金流供應商扣款": "Users can check out: the payment provider is called to charge them",
  "使用者開始失敗（這一秒 {p} 失敗）": "Users start to fail ({p} fail in this second)",
  "使用者開始失敗（這一秒 {p} 失敗），最多的原因：{why}": "Users start to fail ({p} fail in this second). The most common reason: {why}",
  "使用者點短網址，會被帶到原本的網址": "A user who opens a short URL is sent to the original URL",
  "使用者（網頁、API）": "Users (web, API)",
  "來源": "Sources",
  "來源服務": "Origin service",
  "來源負載平衡器": "Origin load balancer",
  "供應商出錯時的重送": "Sending again when the provider fails",
  "供應商每次有 5% 會失敗，而且每次失敗互不相關。失敗了再試一次，兩次都失敗的機率是 5% × 5% = 0.25%。在「API → 地圖供應商」那條線上設重試。重試會讓供應商多收約 5% 的請求，它吃得下；要是它是因為太忙才失敗，重試只會更糟。": "Each call to the provider fails 5% of the time, and one failure does not depend on another. Try again after a failure: both fail 5% × 5% = 0.25% of the time. Set retries on the edge from the API to the map provider. Retries send the provider about 5% more requests, which it can take; if it failed because it was too busy, retries would make it worse.",
  "供應商的計費": "What the provider charges",
  "依使用者提供": "user-provided",
  "依假設": "assumption",
  "依假設：用到估計值和 loadsketch 預設值，見「猜的值」": "an assumption: it uses estimates and loadsketch defaults, see \"Guessed values\"",
