  "保險絲": "Circuit breaker",
  "保險絲。最近一段時間下游失敗太多就「跳開」，之後的請求立刻失敗（circuit_open），不再等下游。過一陣子放少量請求試探，成功就恢復。通常搭配出線的逾時。": "Circuit breaker. If downstream fails too much over a recent window, it opens and later requests fail at once (circuit_open) instead of waiting for downstream. After a while it lets a few requests through as a half-open probe and recovers if they succeed. Usually paired with a timeout on the outgoing edge.",
  "保險絲看到下游一直失敗，就先不打它，直接回失敗，讓下游有時間恢復。": "The circuit breaker saw the downstream fail again and again, so it stops calling it and fails at once. This gives the downstream time to recover.",
  "保險絲跳開": "Circuit breaker opens",
  "保險絲跳開後直接拒絕，不再打已經出問題的下游": "After the circuit breaker opens, it rejects at once and stops calling the failing downstream",
  "保險絲跳開次數": "Circuit breaker trips",
  "保險絲（卡組織）": "Circuit breaker (card networks)",
