  "值班中的系統": "The system on call",
  "值班告警：第 20 秒起，p99 從約 80 ms 跳到約 450 ms。沒有失敗。": "Page: from 20 s, p99 jumps from about 80 ms to about 450 ms. No failures.",
  "值班告警：第 20 秒起，三到四成的請求失敗，p99 升到約 3 秒。": "Page: from 20 s, 30–40% of requests fail and p99 goes up to about 3 s.",
  "值班告警：第 20 秒起，大約 14% 的請求失敗。延遲沒變。": "Page: from 20 s, about 14% of requests fail. Latency does not change.",
  "值班告警：第 20 秒起，大約一成的請求失敗，p99 升到約 750 ms。": "Page: from 20 s, about 10% of requests fail and p99 goes up to about 750 ms.",
  "值班告警：第 20 秒起，大約一成的請求失敗，p99 小幅上升。": "Page: from 20 s, about 10% of requests fail and p99 goes up a little.",
  "值班告警：第 20 秒起，大約三分之一的使用者請求失敗。延遲沒變。": "Page: from 20 s, about a third of user requests fail. Latency does not change.",
  "值班告警：第 20 秒起，大部分請求失敗，p99 升到約 3 秒。": "Page: from 20 s, most requests fail and p99 goes up to about 3 s.",
  "值班告警：第 20 秒起，幾乎所有請求都失敗，之後一直沒有恢復。": "Page: from 20 s, almost all requests fail, and it never recovers.",
  "值班練習": "On-call practice",
  "值班練習中：事件紀錄送出答案後才看得到。": "On call: the event log shows after you answer.",
  "值班練習中：故障藏在這裡，送出答案後才看得到。": "On call: the fault is hidden here. It shows after you answer.",
  "值班練習中：發生了什麼，送出答案後才看得到。": "On call: what happened shows after you answer.",
