  "做完才刪（至少一次）": "Delete after done (at-least-once)",
  "停止": "Stop",
  "偵測故障太慢：Route 53 檢查間隔 {interval} 秒 × 連續失敗 {threshold} 次 = {total} 秒 > 90 秒。": "Failure detection is too slow: Route 53 check interval {interval} s × {threshold} failures in a row = {total} s > 90 s.",
  "偵測故障太慢：健康檢查間隔 {interval} 秒 × 連續失敗 {threshold} 次 = {total} 秒 > 60 秒。": "Failure detection is slow: health check interval {interval} s × {threshold} failures in a row = {total} s > 60 s.",
  "偵測時間": "Detection time",
  "偵測間隔": "Check interval",
  "偶發的錯誤用重試擋：API → db 和 worker → db 都設 2 次重試。只修 API 那一條，背景工作還是會掉兩成。": "Retries stop random errors: set 2 retries on API → db and on worker → db. If you fix only the API connection, the background work still loses one job in five.",
  "像一天的高低峰：流量在 1 ± 振幅之間來回。": "Like the peaks and lows of a day: traffic swings between 1 ± amplitude.",
  "元件": "Component",
  "元件在哪個區域（資料中心），例如 us-east。不同區域之間的呼叫要多花跨區延遲；「整區故障」事件會讓同一區的元件一起故障。": "The region (data center) the component runs in, for example us-east. A call between two regions takes the inter-region latency; a region outage takes all components of the region down together.",
  "元件故障": "Component failure",
  "元件故障，送到它的請求都失敗": "The component is down, so every request sent to it fails",
  "元件本身回傳錯誤": "The component itself returns an error",
  "元件答對 +{n}": "Right component +{n}",
  "元件答錯：是「{name}」": "Wrong component: it was \"{name}\"",
  "元件錯誤": "Component error",
  "元件面板": "Component panel",
  "元件（或其中一台）停止回應。": "The component (or one of its instances) stops answering.",
  "元件（或其中一台）改用這個錯誤率。": "The component (or one of its instances) uses this error rate.",
  "元件（或其中一台）的處理時間乘上倍數。": "The component's (or one instance's) processing time is multiplied.",
  "先估容量。API 處理一個請求時，除了自己的 5 ms，還要等快取或資料庫回應，平均大約佔住位子 7 ms。每秒 20,000 個請求 × 7 ms = 同時要處理約 140 個，預設的 2 台不夠。資料庫：讀取每秒 19,000 次 × 3 ms = 57 條連線，寫入每秒 1,000 次 × 10 ms = 10 條，一共 67 條，預設只有 50 條。可以把資料庫開大，也可以在前面放快取擋掉九成的讀取；兩種都算算看，價錢差不多。": "Estimate the capacity first. While the API handles a request it also waits for the cache or the database, so it holds a slot for about 7 ms, not only its own 5 ms. 20,000 requests per second × 7 ms = about 140 in progress at one time; the default 2 instances are not enough. The database: 19,000 reads per second × 3 ms = 57 connections, and 1,000 writes per second × 10 ms = 10 more: 67 in all, and the default is 50. You can make the database larger, or put a cache in front to take 90% of the reads. Work out both; the prices are close.",
  "先來先做（FIFO）": "First in, first out (FIFO)",
  "先壞": "breaks first.",
  "先猜紀錄": "Guess log",
  "先猜，再執行": "Guess first, then run",
  "先算要幾台。尖峰每秒 900 個請求 × 每個 20 ms = 同時有 18 個在處理；每台同時處理 8 個，所以要 3 台，不是 6 台。自動擴充在這裡幫不上忙：新機器開機要 2 分鐘，尖峰也只有 2 分鐘，機器好了尖峰已經過了，還多 1 點複雜度。固定開 3 台就夠。": "Count the instances first. The peak is 900 requests per second × 20 ms each = 18 in progress at one time. Each instance handles 8 at a time, so you need 3 instances, not 6. Autoscaling does not help here: a new machine takes 2 minutes to start and the peak lasts 2 minutes, so the machines are ready when the peak is over, and autoscaling costs 1 more complexity point. 3 fixed instances are enough.",
  "入口與網路": "Ingress and network",
  "入門": "Getting started",
  "內容快取": "Content cache",
  "全程：成功 {ok}，錯誤率 {err}，p99 {p99}": "Whole run: {ok} success, error rate {err}, p99 {p99}",
  "全部": "All",
  "全部伺服器": "every server",
  "全部伺服器（{k} 個元件）": "every server ({k} components)",
  "全部共用一個": "All share one",
  "全部實例合計最多存幾個 key。": "Max keys stored across all instances.",
  "全部（全域推送）": "All (global push)",
  "兩個區域之間斷線：互相的呼叫和複製都送不到（呼叫端逾時），使用者兩邊都連得到。資料庫開了自動 failover 時，副本那一側會升新主庫，舊主庫還在收寫入（split brain）。": "The network between two regions is cut: calls and replication between them are lost (the caller times out); users reach both sides. A database with automatic failover promotes a new primary on the replicas' side while the old one still takes writes (split brain).",
  "兩個區域各有一組 API 和快取，資料庫在東區。DNS 先把全部流量送到東區。情境在第 30 秒把流量整個移到西區（流量移轉事件）。兩個快取之間的線是跨區複製：一邊寫入或刪除快取，會在跨區延遲之後套到另一邊，所以西區快取一直是熱的。試試看：刪掉兩條快取之間的線再跑一次，西區接手後命中率掉下來，資料庫的讀取量突然變大。沒有跨區複製時，另一個做法是把移轉時間改長（例如 20 秒）：西區先接一小部分流量，快取自己慢慢熱起來。": "Each of two regions has an API and a cache; the database is in the east. DNS first sends all traffic to the east. The scenario moves all of it to the west at 30 s (a traffic shift event). The edges between the two caches are cross-region replication: a cache set or delete on one side is applied to the other after the inter-region latency, so the west cache stays warm. Try it: delete the two edges between the caches and run again. When the west takes over, its hit ratio drops and the database reads jump. Without replication, another way is a longer shift time (for example 20 s): the west takes a small part of the traffic first, and its cache warms up by itself.",
  "兩個都限": "Limit both",
  "兩邊都以為自己是對的": "Each side thinks it is the right one",
  "公司共用的資料庫": "Shared database",
  "公開事故的重現，和知名服務的完整架構：好幾個機制一起出現。": "Reproductions of public incidents and whole architectures of well-known services: several mechanisms at once.",
  "共用的資料庫有 50 條連線，讀一筆 3 ms、寫一筆 10 ms；它不歸你管，改不了": "The shared database has 50 connections, a read takes 3 ms and a write 10 ms; it is not yours, so you cannot change it",
