  "分片資料庫": "Sharded database",
  "分片資料庫一邊服務一邊改分片數：複製資料的這段時間每份都變慢，結束時 key 改照新的分片數分配（key 除以分片數的餘數）。拆開熱分片，或合併太空的分片。": "Change the shard count of a sharded database while it serves: while the data is copied every shard is slower; at the end the keys go by the new count (key mod shards). Split hot shards, or merge idle ones.",
