  "前台 p99 {p99} ms，上限 {limit} ms。": "Front-end p99 {p99} ms, limit {limit} ms.",
  "前台失敗率 {pct}%（{failed}／{offered}），上限 {limit}%。": "Front-end failure rate {pct}% ({failed} of {offered}), limit {limit}%.",
  "前門比後門寬：節流放進 {rate} rps，{target} 大約只接得住 {capacity} rps（{formula}）。": "The front door is wider than the back: the throttle lets in {rate} rps, but {target} can take only about {capacity} rps ({formula}).",
  "前門：驗證、依讀寫分流到後端。它是代理，會占著位置等後端回應。": "Front door: validates and routes reads and writes to the backend. It is a proxy, so it holds a slot while it waits for the backend.",
  "剔除多久": "Ejection time",
  "剔除後多久再放回來試。": "How long until an ejected instance is tried again.",
  "副本": "Replicas",
  "副本 {r}": "Replica {r}",
  "副本升為主庫的次數": "Times a replica became the primary",
  "副本套用寫入成本": "Replica applies write cost",
  "副本延遲上限": "Max replication lag",
  "副本所在區域": "Replica region",
  "副本落後超過這個時間，讀取就不送給它（像 proxy 的 max replication lag 檢查）。全部副本都太落後時，讀主庫。0 表示不檢查。": "Reads skip a replica that lags more than this (like a proxy max replication lag check). If all replicas lag too much, read the primary. 0 means no check.",
  "功能": "Features",
  "功能需求": "Functional requirements",
  "加 RDS Proxy、調小每台的連線池、降低自動擴充上限，或換大一點的機型。": "Add RDS Proxy, make each instance's pool smaller, lower the autoscaling maximum, or use a larger instance class.",
  "加 RDS Proxy，或用 reserved_concurrent_executions／maximum_concurrency 限制併發。": "Add RDS Proxy, or limit concurrency with reserved_concurrent_executions or maximum_concurrency.",
  "加 aws_appautoscaling_target（dynamodb），或改用 PAY_PER_REQUEST。": "Add an aws_appautoscaling_target (dynamodb), or use PAY_PER_REQUEST.",
  "加一個 API": "Add an API",
  "加了新的{kind}「{name}」": "Added a new {kind} \"{name}\"",
  "加容量：API Server 加到 12 台，資料庫連線加到 32。": "Add capacity: 12 API Server instances, 32 database connections.",
  "加機器能撐住，但超出預算；每一跳加重試預算又超出點數。先拿掉放大流量的重試，再把每台 API Server 的同時處理數調大一點（比加一台便宜）。": "More machines hold the load but go over the budget; a retry budget on every hop goes over the points. First remove the retries that multiply the load, then raise each API Server's concurrency a little (cheaper than another instance).",
  "加機器／減機器": "Added / removed",
  "加讀副本或快取，或用 RDS Proxy 共用連線。": "Add read replicas or a cache, or share connections with RDS Proxy.",
  "加讀副本最直覺，但多 1 點，也比較貴。拿掉副本，把主庫的規格開大（在這裡是調大它同時能處理的查詢數，價錢會跟著漲）：快取已經擋掉大部分讀取，主庫只要接得住沒命中的那些。": "Read replicas are the obvious fix, but they cost 1 more point and more money. Remove the replica and move the primary to a larger size (here: raise the number of queries it handles at the same time; the price goes up with it): the cache already takes most reads, so the primary only needs to take the misses.",
