  "只有需求和幾乎空白的畫布。自己決定要哪些元件、開多大，跑一次看撐不撐得住。常見的第一版設計都過不了關。": "Only the requirements and an almost empty canvas. You decide which components to use and how large, then run it to see if it holds. The first design most people draw does not pass.",
