  "商品頁 API": "Product page API",
  "商品頁 API 4 台，每台 32 個槽；每個請求先查 Postgres，再呼叫推薦服務（逾時 1 秒）。第 20 秒起推薦服務變慢 50 倍。API 的每個槽都卡在等推薦服務，連不需要等的部分也做不了：佇列滿了，約一半的請求失敗。推薦只是「加分」的內容，卻拖垮了整個商品頁。試試「隔艙＋降級回應」版本。": "Four product page API instances with 32 slots each; every request reads Postgres, then calls the recommendation service (timeout 1 s). From second 20 the recommendation service becomes 50 times slower. Every API slot waits on it, so even the work that does not need it cannot run: the queue fills up and about half of the requests fail. Recommendations are only a nice extra, yet they take down the whole product page. Try the \"Bulkhead + fallback\" version.",
  "商家 webhook 端點（外部）": "Merchant webhook endpoint (external)",
