  "已開機的 client（送訊息、讀訊息）": "Started clients (send and read messages)",
  "希望每台平均多忙。需要的台數 = 現有台數 × 忙碌率 ÷ 目標（差不到 10% 就不動）。": "Target average utilization per instance. Instances needed = current instances × utilization ÷ target (no change if within 10%).",
  "帳戶 API": "Account API",
  "帳戶異動佇列（FIFO）": "Account changes queue (FIFO)",
  "帳戶異動要依序處理，所以佇列設成 FIFO：同一個帳戶（同一組）的訊息一次只交出一則。少數訊息內容有問題（毒訊息，每 1000 則 1 則），每次處理都失敗；至少一次交付下，它要等 visibility timeout 後重新出現、再失敗，5 次後才進 DLQ。這段約 50 秒裡，同一組後面的訊息全部等著（看佇列的「排在同組後面等」和非同步延遲 p99）。試試看：(1) 把佇列的「訊息分組數」從 8 調到 256：一則毒訊息只卡住 1/256 的帳戶；(2) 把 visibility timeout 從 10 秒降到 2 秒，或「最多接收次數」從 5 降到 2：壞訊息更快進 DLQ；(3) 不需要順序的話改回「一般」，壞訊息就不擋別人。": "Account changes must be applied in order, so the queue is FIFO: one message per account group at a time. A few messages are bad (poison, 1 in 1,000) and fail every time; with at-least-once delivery each one comes back after the visibility timeout, fails again, and goes to the DLQ only after 5 tries. For those ~50 s every later message of its group waits (see the queue's \"Waited behind its group\" and the async p99). Try this: (1) raise the queue's \"Message groups\" from 8 to 256: a poison message blocks 1/256 of the accounts; (2) lower the visibility timeout from 10 s to 2 s, or \"Max receives\" from 5 to 2: bad messages reach the DLQ sooner; (3) if order does not matter, switch back to \"Standard\" and a bad message blocks no one.",
