  "延遲目標未達：{slow} / {n} 秒的 p99 超過 {ms} ms": "Latency objective missed: in {slow} / {n} seconds the p99 was over {ms} ms",
  "延遲目標未達：整場的 p99 超過 {ms} ms": "Latency objective missed: the p99 of the run was over {ms} ms",
  "延遲目標達到：p99 ≤ {ms} ms": "Latency objective met: p99 ≤ {ms} ms",
  "延遲（成功的請求）": "Latency (successful requests)",
  "建立 PaymentIntent 的路徑：商家 SDK（指數退避 + jitter 重試）→ LB → 四層限流與降載（每個使用者的請求速率、每個使用者的並行數、保留機群給關鍵請求、worker 忙碌時先丟測試模式流量）→ 付款 API → idempotency 記錄 → DocDB proxy → 分片資料庫（每個 shard 是 replica set）→ 保險絲 → 卡組織授權。成功後非同步寫帳本（ledger）和送 webhook。2019-07-10 一個被 API 和多個應用共用的 shard 選不出主庫、停止接受寫入，API 的運算資源被卡住，大多數 API 請求失敗。來源：https://stripe.com/rcas/2019-07-10 、https://stripe.com/blog/rate-limiters 、https://stripe.com/blog/idempotency 、https://stripe.dev/blog/how-stripes-document-databases-supported-99.999-uptime-with-zero-downtime-data-migrations 、https://stripe.dev/blog/ledger-stripe-system-for-tracking-and-validating-money-movement 。參數是教學用的縮小值；卡組織呼叫方式與 idempotency 儲存位置 Stripe 未公開。": "The path of creating a PaymentIntent: merchant SDK (exponential backoff + jitter retries) → LB → four layers of rate limiting and load shedding (request rate per user, concurrent requests per user, a fleet reserve for critical requests, test-mode traffic dropped first when workers are busy) → payments API → idempotency record → DocDB proxy → sharded database (each shard a replica set) → circuit breaker → card network authorization. After a success the ledger is written and the webhook sent asynchronously. On 2019-07-10 a shard shared by the API and several applications could not elect a primary and stopped accepting writes; the API's compute was held up and most API requests failed. Sources: https://stripe.com/rcas/2019-07-10 , https://stripe.com/blog/rate-limiters , https://stripe.com/blog/idempotency , https://stripe.dev/blog/how-stripes-document-databases-supported-99.999-uptime-with-zero-downtime-data-migrations , https://stripe.dev/blog/ledger-stripe-system-for-tracking-and-validating-money-movement . The parameters are scaled down for teaching; Stripe has not published how it calls the card networks or where idempotency keys are stored.",
  "建立連線": "Connection setup",
