  "得分：{n}": "Score: {n}",
  "從下面的「元件」加元件、連起來，再按「執行」。每次跑完都會自動判定。": "Add components from \"Component\" below, connect them, then press \"Run\". Every run is judged automatically.",
  "從使用者出發的線預設 20 ms（網際網路），其他預設 0.5 ms（同機房）。": "Edges from Users default to 20 ms (internet), other edges to 0.5 ms (same data center).",
  "從左邊拉元件進來、連起來，再按「執行」。每次跑完都會自動判定。": "Drag components in from the left, connect them, then press \"Run\". Every run is judged automatically.",
  "從排隊中先拿哪個請求。過載時，排最久的請求，呼叫端多半已經放棄了；先做最新的請求，做完的才有人收。adaptive LIFO：平常 FIFO，排隊超過 100 ms 都沒清空時改成 LIFO。": "Which queued request to take first. Under overload, the client of the oldest request has usually given up already; serving the newest request first means someone receives the result. Adaptive LIFO: FIFO normally, LIFO when the queue has not emptied for 100 ms.",
  "從檔案加入版本": "Add versions from a file",
