  "快取停掉又冷啟動後的驚群（參考 Instagram）": "Thundering herd after the cache restarts cold (after Instagram)",
  "快取只有一個節點：它出事時快取全部不見。": "The cache has only one node: when it fails, the whole cache is gone.",
  "快取命中 {p}": "Cache hit {p}",
  "快取命中率最高 90%": "The cache hit ratio is 90% at most",
  "快取擊穿、腦裂、壞設定推送。每一個都能跑，都能改。": "Cache stampede. Split brain. A bad config push. Run them. Change them.",
  "快取擊穿（熱門 key 過期）": "Cache stampede (hot key expires)",
  "快取整個故障。讀取會改讀資料庫，資料庫接得住（使用率不到一成）。問題在 API → 快取的重試：每個讀取先對壞掉的快取重試 3 次，每次還要等退避時間，這段時間一直佔住 API 的槽。API 的槽被佔滿，負載平衡器 → API 開始逾時並重試，請求數被放大（重試風暴），之後一直恢復不了。API Server 看起來最忙，但它是受害者。": "The whole cache is down. Reads go to the database, and the database can take them (it is less than 10% busy). The problem is the retries on API → cache: each read retries the dead cache 3 times and waits for the backoff each time, and it holds an API slot all that time. The API slots fill up, load balancer → API starts to time out and retry, and the number of requests multiplies (a retry storm). The system does not recover. The API servers look the busiest, but they are the victim.",
