  "成功請求的延遲（ms）：平均 {mean}，p50 {p50}，p95 {p95}，p99 {p99}，p99.9 {p999}，最大 {max}": "Latency of successful requests (ms): mean {mean}, p50 {p50}, p95 {p95}, p99 {p99}, p99.9 {p999}, max {max}",
