  "扇出": "Fan-out",
  "扇出 {n}": "fan-out {n}",
  "扇出 {n}，等 {k}": "fan-out {n}, wait {k}",
  "扇出時，成功的份數到這個數字就回覆，不等其他份（像 Cassandra、DynamoDB 的 quorum：3 份等 2 份）。失敗太多、湊不到這個數字時就失敗。沒等到的份數仍會做完。0 表示等全部。": "With fan-out, answer as soon as this many copies succeed, without waiting for the rest (a quorum, as in Cassandra or DynamoDB: 2 of 3 copies). When too many fail to reach this number, the call fails. The copies not waited for still run to the end. 0 means wait for all.",
  "扇出查詢（scatter-gather）": "Fan-out query (scatter-gather)",
  "扇出送出的份數": "Fan-out copies sent",
  "扇出（同時送幾份）": "Fan-out (copies sent at once)",
