  "找不到外面的流量從哪裡進來（例如對外的負載平衡器）。": "Cannot find where outside traffic comes in (for example, an internet-facing load balancer).",
  "找到 {n} 個": "{n} found",
  "找極限（沒給尖峰流量）": "Limit search (no peak given)",
  "把 API → recs 的逾時調短（例如 100 ms），並打開降級回應：推薦拿不到就先回沒有推薦的頁面。": "Make the API → recs timeout short (for example 100 ms) and turn on the fallback: without recommendations, return the page without them.",
  "把 Terraform plan（terraform show -json 的輸出）轉成設計": "Turn a Terraform plan (the output of terraform show -json) into a design",
  "把 Terraform plan（terraform show -json）轉成設計檔": "Turn a Terraform plan (terraform show -json) into a design file",
  "把 max_capacity 設得比 min_capacity 大。": "Set max_capacity higher than min_capacity.",
  "把 request_interval 改成 10，或降低 failure_threshold。": "Set request_interval to 10, or lower failure_threshold.",
  "把 visibility_timeout_seconds 設成至少函式 timeout 的 6 倍（AWS 建議）。": "Set visibility_timeout_seconds to at least 6 times the function timeout (AWS recommendation).",
  "把一條線的權重改掉：DNS、負載平衡器或使用者照權重分流，所以這就是金絲雀發布、藍綠切換或撤出一個區域。可以在一段時間內慢慢移。": "Change the weight of an edge. DNS, load balancers and clients split traffic by weight, so this is a canary release, a blue-green cutover or a region evacuation. The move can be gradual.",
  "把函式的 timeout 設得比呼叫端的逾時短。": "Make the function timeout shorter than the caller's timeout.",
  "把失敗的比例換算成一個月（30 天）完全停機的時間。99.9% 約是每月 43 分鐘。": "The failed share as full downtime in a month (30 days). 99.9% is about 43 minutes a month.",
  "把子網路分到至少兩個 AZ。": "Put the subnets in at least two AZs.",
  "把所有版本存成一個檔案": "Save all versions to one file",
  "把排隊上限調小後，被拒絕的呼叫會被重試，又把流量放大。再加上重試預算，限制重試的總量。": "With a smaller queue limit, the rejected calls are retried, and that multiplies the traffic again. Add a retry budget to limit the total of retries.",
  "把節流設得比後端容量低，或提高後端容量。": "Set the throttle below the backend capacity, or give the backend more capacity.",
  "把網域名稱換成 IP。客戶端會快取結果，所以只有少數請求要多等一次查詢。有多條出線時依權重分流（例如分到兩個區域）。開啟 failover 時，會把故障的目標從答案裡拿掉。": "Turns a domain name into an IP address. Clients cache the answer, so only a few requests wait for a lookup. With several outgoing edges it splits traffic by weight (for example across two regions). With failover on, it removes failed targets from its answer.",
  "把設計和情境放進一個網址，貼給別人就能打開": "Put the design and the scenario into one URL: anyone who opens it gets both",
  "把請求分給後面所有節點的所有實例。可以選分配策略。會跳過它認為不健康的實例：預設立刻知道哪台故障；也可以改成定期 health check，或看回應自動剔除出錯的實例（outlier detection）。容量視為無限。": "Spreads requests across all instances of all downstream nodes. You can pick a distribution policy. It skips instances it thinks are unhealthy: by default it knows at once which instance is down; you can also use periodic health checks, or eject failing instances from their replies (outlier detection). Capacity is unlimited.",
  "把負載平衡器的策略改成最少連線（least connections）：慢的那台連線多，就少送給它。": "Change the load balancer's policy to least connections: the slow instance has more open connections, so it gets fewer requests.",
  "把這個版本的設計和情境放回畫布": "Put this version's design and scenario back on the canvas",
  "拖到畫布上，或點一下加到中間。": "Drag onto the canvas, or click to add it in the middle.",
  "拖曳調整寬度，連按兩下恢復預設": "Drag to change the width; double-click for the default",
  "拿到 lease 的請求要在這段時間內把值寫回快取；過了還沒寫回，下一個沒命中的請求拿新的 lease。": "The request that holds the lease must write the value back within this time. If it does not, the next miss gets a new lease.",
  "持續": "Lasts",
  "指數分布（cv 1）": "Exponential (cv 1)",
  "指標": "Metrics",
  "指標面板": "Metrics panel",
  "按「執行」。跑完後，這裡會顯示 SLA、成本，並照時間說明發生了什麼。範例的題目和挑戰目前只有「重試風暴」有；限制條件題目、值班練習和先猜紀錄在上方的「練習」。": "Press \"Run\". When the run ends, this tab shows the SLA, the cost, and what happened, in time order. Only the \"Retry storm\" example has questions and challenges for now; constraint problems, on-call practice and the guess log are under \"Practice\" at the top.",
