  "排隊順序": "Queue order",
  "控制排隊延遲（CoDel，Facebook 的做法）。排隊在最近 100 ms 內清空過：一個請求最多排 100 ms；一直沒清空（塞車）：最多排這麼久。超過的請求輪到時直接丟掉（CoDel），不做白工。Facebook 用 5 ms。0 表示不用。": "Controls queueing delay (CoDel, as Facebook does it). If the queue emptied in the last 100 ms, a request may wait at most 100 ms; if it has not (congestion), at most this long. A request over the limit is dropped when its turn comes (CoDel), so no work is wasted. Facebook uses 5 ms. 0 means off.",
  "控制面 {id}：看不到監控、沒有動作 {n} 次": "Control plane {id}: blind, did not act {n} times",
  "控制面呼叫失敗，自動擴充、failover 或 DNS 檢查這次沒有動作": "Times a control call failed, so the autoscaler, failover or DNS check did not act",
  "控制面（監控、協調）": "Control plane (metrics, coordination)",
