  "推定線": "presumed line",
  "推薦服務": "Recommendations",
  "推薦服務變慢 50 倍": "Recommendations become 50× slower",
  "推薦服務（recs）整個變慢 30 倍。API 每個請求都要等它，逾時 1 秒；等待中的請求佔住 API 的槽，API 的佇列滿了，連不需要推薦的請求也一起失敗。API 的使用率很高，但它是受害者：佔住它的是在等 recs 的請求。": "The whole recommendation service (recs) is 30× slower. Each API request waits for it, with a 1 s timeout; the waiting requests hold the API's slots, the API's queue fills up, and even requests that need no recommendations fail. The API is very busy, but it is the victim: the requests that hold it are waiting for recs.",
  "推薦／個人化（us-east）": "Recommendations/personalization (us-east)",
  "推薦／個人化（us-west）": "Recommendations/personalization (us-west)",
