  "搜尋索引（16 個分片）": "Search index (16 shards)",
  "搜尋要問每個分片：搜尋 API 把每個查詢同時送給 16 個分片（扇出 16），等全部回來才合併結果。一個分片讀一次平均 8 ms，但查詢要等 16 個裡最慢的那個，所以長尾被放大：只問一個分片時 p50 51 ms、p99 82 ms；問 16 個時 p50 71 ms、p99 106 ms（含使用者來回 40 ms）。第 20 秒起分片 5 變慢 10 倍。每個查詢都會碰到它，變慢期間 p99 升到約 413 ms。把這條線的「Quorum」設成 15（少一個分片也先回結果，像 Google 的 good-enough 回應）：p99 降到約 99 ms，代價是少數結果缺一個分片。": "A search must ask every shard: the search API sends each query to all 16 shards at once (fan-out 16) and merges the results when all are back. One shard read takes 8 ms on average, but a query waits for the slowest of 16, so the tail grows: asking one shard gives p50 51 ms and p99 82 ms; asking 16 gives p50 71 ms and p99 106 ms (including the users' 40 ms round trip). From 20 s, shard 5 is 10× slower. Every query touches it: while it is slow, p99 goes up to about 413 ms. Set this edge's \"Quorum\" to 15 (answer without one shard, like Google's good-enough responses): p99 goes down to about 99 ms, but a few results miss one shard.",
