  "最多一次：worker 失敗或故障，訊息就遺失。至少一次（像 SQS）：worker 成功才刪除；失敗或太慢，訊息在 visibility timeout 後重新出現，可能被處理兩次。": "At most once: if the worker fails or crashes, the message is lost. At least once (like SQS): delete only when the worker succeeds; if it fails or is too slow, the message comes back after the visibility timeout and may be processed twice.",
