  "最少連線（least connections）": "Least connections",
  "最常見的起點：負載平衡器把請求分給 3 台 API 伺服器；讀取先查快取（cache-aside），沒命中才查資料庫副本；寫入進主庫，再讓快取失效。": "The most common starting point: the load balancer spreads requests over 3 API servers; reads check the cache first (cache-aside) and go to the database replica only on a miss; writes go to the primary, then the cache is invalidated.",
  "最忙": "Busiest",
  "最忙的一秒": "Busiest second",
  "最忙的元件：{node}（忙碌率 {pct}%）": "Busiest component: {node} (utilization {pct}%)",
  "最近 10 秒內，這條線的重試數最多是首次呼叫數的幾倍（Google 建議 0.1 = 10%）。超過就不重試，直接回報失敗。0 表示不限。": "In the last 10 s, how many times the first-call count the retries on this edge can reach (Google suggests 0.1 = 10%). Above that, no retry and the call reports failure right away. 0 means no limit.",
  "最近一秒的平均忙碌程度": "Average utilization in the last second",
