  "有結束時間": "Has an end",
  "有自動擴充的服務接到沒有副本、沒有快取的單一 DB：{formula} = {total} > 連線上限 {max} 的 80%（{limit}）。": "An autoscaled service uses a single DB with no replica and no cache: {formula} = {total} > 80% of the connection limit {max} ({limit}).",
  "有請求因排隊滿被拒，理論值假設排隊無上限，僅供參考。": "Some requests were rejected because the queue was full; the theory value assumes an unlimited queue, for reference only.",
  "有迴圈：{loop}。請求會一直繞，請拿掉其中一條線。": "There is a loop: {loop}. Requests keep going around, so remove one of the edges.",
  "服務水準（SLO）": "Service level (SLO)",
  "未儲存": "Not saved",
  "未命名設計": "Untitled design",
  "未啟動": "Not started",
  "未達 {target}": "Missed {target}",
  "東西兩區各有一組 API，DNS 把使用者平均分到兩區。資料庫的主庫在東區，副本在西區，開了自動 failover。情境在第 20 秒切斷兩區之間的網路 40 秒。西區連不到主庫，以為它故障：failover 時間過後，西區的副本升為新主庫。可是舊主庫還活著，東區的使用者還在寫它：兩邊各自收寫入，分區結束後資料分歧（看資料庫的「分歧寫入」和時間軸）。試試看：把資料庫的「隔離舊主庫（fencing）」打開再跑一次。不再分歧，代價是分區期間東區的寫入失敗。": "Each of two regions has its own API; DNS splits users evenly between them. The database's primary is in the east and its replica in the west, with automatic failover. The scenario cuts the network between the regions at 20 s for 40 s. The west cannot reach the primary and thinks it is down: after the failover time, the west replica becomes the new primary. But the old primary still runs, and east users still write to it: both sides take writes, and the data diverges when the partition ends (see the database's \"Divergent writes\" and the timeline). Try this: turn on the database's \"Fence the old primary\" and run again. No more divergence; the cost is that east writes fail during the partition.",
  "查地址 API": "Address API",
  "查詢": "Lookup",
  "查詢時間": "Query time",
  "查詢有送到地圖供應商": "Lookups reach the map provider",
  "格式不對": "Bad format",
  "桶子最多存幾個令牌，也就是一次最多放行幾個。": "How many tokens the bucket holds, that is how many can pass at one time.",
  "模型怎麼算": "How the model works",
