  "模擬 1/{k}，數字已換算：流量和容量都除以 {k}，請求數、rps、錯誤數乘回 {k}。": "Simulated at 1/{k}; numbers scaled back: traffic and capacity are divided by {k}, and requests, rps and errors are multiplied by {k}.",
