  "機型表沒有 {type}，所以沒有填效能假設（用 loadsketch 的預設值）；可以在答案檔填。": "The instance table has no {type}, so no performance assumptions are filled in (the loadsketch defaults are used). You can set them in the answer file.",
  "檔案": "File",
