  "節點從多條線選一條時，依權重選。": "When a node picks one of several edges, it picks by weight.",
  "範例": "Examples",
  "簡化：Django 是同一組伺服器，NGINX 把所有請求交給它；Django 依 API 呼叫不同的下游（每條線上標了它走哪些 API）。Redis 用一般服務表示，每次讀 feed 都會查。pgbouncer、Munin、Sentry、Fabric 沒有畫。12 個分片是原文的數字；台數、毫秒都是縮小值。真實的 Memcached 重啟後怎麼暖機（例如先導一小部分流量）模擬器做不到。": "Simplified: Django is one group of servers, and NGINX sends every request to it; Django calls different downstreams per API (each edge shows the APIs it carries). Redis is a plain service, queried on every feed read. pgbouncer, Munin, Sentry and Fabric are not drawn. The 12 shards are the number from the source; server counts and milliseconds are scaled down. How real Memcached servers warm up after a restart (for example, by sending them a small part of the traffic first) is beyond the simulator.",
  "簡化：Netflix 跑三個 AWS 區域，這裡只畫兩個。幾百個微服務合成一個 API 服務和一個推薦服務。EVCache 和 Cassandra 的跨區複製都沒有模擬，每區各自一份；切區時快取變冷造成的驚群也模擬不了。真實的切區是 Zuul 和 DNS 一起慢慢搬流量，這裡只有 DNS failover。Open Connect 的命中率 98% 和所有台數、毫秒都是縮小值。": "Simplified: Netflix runs in three AWS regions; only two are shown here. Hundreds of microservices are combined into one API service and one recommendation service. The cross-region replication of EVCache and Cassandra is not simulated, and each region has its own copy; the thundering herd from caches that go cold when traffic moves cannot be simulated either. A real region evacuation moves traffic slowly with Zuul and DNS together; here there is only DNS failover. The 98% Open Connect hit ratio and all server counts and milliseconds are small values.",
  "簡化：司機和乘客 App 合成一個使用者節點，用讀取比例 30% 表示；寫入裡有一小部分是建立行程。真實的附近查詢會依 S2 coverage 同時查好幾個 cell（扇出），這裡一次讀取只查一個分片。ringpop 的 gossip、轉送、節點加入和離開時的重新分配都沒有模擬。資料中心故障時用司機手機上的狀態摘要（state digest）復原，也沒有對應元件。": "Simplified: the driver and rider apps are combined into one user node, with a read ratio of 30%; a small part of the writes create trips. A real nearby query reads several cells at the same time from the S2 coverage (fan-out); here one read goes to only one shard. ringpop's gossip, forwarding, and rebalancing when nodes join and leave are not simulated. In a data center failure, Uber recovers with the state digest on the drivers' phones; there is no component for that either.",
  "簡化：真實 broker 會同時扇出到很多分區、取全部結果合併，延遲由最慢的分區決定；模擬器的 service 會呼叫每個下游，但同一種下游只有一條線，所以這裡只畫一個分區的副本組。Jetty 的 accept queue 和 request queue 兩層，這裡合成一個排隊上限。": "Simplified: a real broker fans out to many partitions at once and merges all the results, so the slowest partition sets the latency. A service in the simulator calls each downstream, but one kind of downstream has one connection, so only the replica set of one partition is drawn. Jetty has two queues (accept and request); here they are one queue limit.",
  "簡化：真實事故是 shard 選不出主庫（寫入不可用），模擬器沒有選主過程，這裡用「主庫極慢」表示。隔艙（bulkhead）是每條線一個上限，不是每個 shard 一個，所以不能用它隔離單一 shard。也沒有 idempotency 語意（同一個 key 重送不會重複扣款），重試在這裡會真的再跑一次。": "Simplified: in the real incident the shard could not elect a primary (writes unavailable). The simulator has no election, so \"the primary is extremely slow\" stands in for it. A bulkhead is one limit per connection, not per shard, so it cannot isolate one shard. There are no idempotency semantics either (resending the same key does not charge twice): here a retry really runs again.",
  "簡化：真實事故是網路分區，美東的主庫其實還活著、還收了幾秒寫入；這裡用「整區故障」表示。舊主庫回來後直接當副本，沒有模擬資料比對、從備份還原（真實事故花了 24 小時）。沒有半同步複製，也沒有「只在同一區 failover」的規則。webhook 在事故中被暫停、積壓超過 500 萬個，這裡只放了佇列和 worker。": "Simplified: the real incident was a network partition; the East Coast primary was still alive and took writes for a few seconds. Here it is a region outage. The old primary comes back as a replica at once; comparing the data and restoring from backups (24 hours in the real incident) is not simulated. There is no semi-synchronous replication and no rule to fail over only within a region. Webhooks were paused during the incident and over 5 million piled up; here there is only the queue and the workers.",
  "簡化：真實的 boot 查詢是 scatter query（打所有 shard），模擬器沒有 scatter-gather，這裡只能用一般讀取表示。Gateway Server 的 websocket 長連線、Channel Server 的一致性雜湊環也沒有對應元件。": "Simplified: the real boot query is a scatter query (it hits every shard). The simulator has no scatter-gather, so a plain read stands in for it. There are no parts for the Gateway Server's websocket connections or the Channel Server's consistent-hash ring either.",
  "簡訊供應商送一則平均 200 ms，這個改不了": "The provider takes 200 ms on average for one message, and you cannot change that",
  "簡訊供應商（外部）": "SMS provider (outside)",
  "簡訊內容和範本": "Message text and templates",
  "簡訊有送到供應商": "Messages reach the provider",
  "系統裡偷偷放了一個故障。你只看得到使用者的失敗率和 p99；要看元件的指標得花點數。找出哪個元件、哪種故障，再到畫布上修好。": "A fault is hidden in the system. You see only the users' error rate and p99; a component's own metrics cost points. Find the component and the kind of fault, then fix it on the canvas.",
