  "結論": "Finding",
  "統計窗口太長，暖機後放不下一個完整窗口，已改成 {s} 秒。": "The stats window is too long to fit a full window after warm-up, so it was changed to {s} s.",
  "統計視窗": "Stats window",
  "統計視窗內失敗比例超過這個值就跳開。": "The circuit breaker opens when the failure ratio in the stats window is above this value.",
  "經過 RDS Proxy 的連線池加總可能超過 Proxy 上限：{formula} = {total} > {limit}（扣掉 OS 保留後的估計；用全部記憶體算是 {high}）。": "Connection pools through RDS Proxy may add up to more than the proxy limit: {formula} = {total} > {limit} (estimated after the OS reserve; {high} with all memory).",
  "經過 RDS Proxy 的連線池加總超過 Proxy 上限：{formula} = {total} > {limit}。": "Connection pools through RDS Proxy add up to more than the proxy limit: {formula} = {total} > {limit}.",
  "網址裡沒有分享的設計": "The URL holds no shared design",
  "網址資料庫": "URL database",
  "網路": "Network",
  "網路分區": "Network partition",
  "網路分區時，副本那一側以為主庫故障，升了新主庫。舊主庫其實還活著，它那一側的使用者還在寫：兩邊各自收寫入（split brain），分區結束後資料分歧。開啟 fencing（像 STONITH 或 epoch token）時，新主庫一升起，舊主庫就拒絕寫入。": "In a network partition, the replicas' side thinks the primary is down and promotes a new one. The old primary still runs, and users on its side still write to it: both sides take writes (split brain), and the data diverges when the partition ends. With fencing (like STONITH or an epoch token), the old primary refuses writes as soon as the new one is up.",
  "網路分區時，舊主庫在新主庫升起後收的寫入（split brain）：新主庫沒有這些資料": "Writes the old primary took after the new one was promoted during a network partition (split brain): the new primary does not have them",
  "網路分區結束：區域 {a} 和 {b} 恢復連線": "Network partition over: regions {a} and {b} are connected again",
  "網路分區要兩個不同的區域。": "A network partition needs two different regions.",
  "網路分區：兩個主庫（split brain）": "Network partition: two primaries (split brain)",
  "網路分區：區域 {a} 和 {b} 之間斷線": "Network partition: the network between regions {a} and {b} is cut",
  "網路延遲（單程）": "Network latency (one way)",
  "網路設定：用來找候選線，不畫成元件。": "Network setting: used to find candidate lines, not a component.",
  "網頁與 API 的路徑：使用者 → DNS → GLB Director（L4）→ HAProxy（L7）→ Rails 應用 → 授權服務、Memcached、MySQL。寫入另外排進 webhook 佇列，由 worker 送給外部接收端。MySQL 主庫和兩個副本在美東，另兩個副本在美西，複製是非同步的；orchestrator 會在主庫失聯時把副本升為主庫。2018-10-21 UTC 22:52 更換光學設備的維護讓美東資料中心和網路樞紐斷線 43 秒。orchestrator 把美西的副本升為主庫；美東主庫上有幾秒還沒複製到美西的寫入（一個忙碌的叢集有 954 筆），無法安全地切回。網路恢復後，美東的應用每次寫入都要跨國往返，頁面變慢，降級持續 24 小時 11 分鐘。來源：https://github.blog/news-insights/company-news/oct21-post-incident-analysis/ 、https://github.blog/engineering/infrastructure/glb-director-open-source-load-balancer/ 、https://github.blog/engineering/infrastructure/mitigating-replication-lag-and-reducing-read-load-with-freno/ 、https://github.blog/engineering/infrastructure/stretching-spokes/ 。參數是教學用的縮小值。": "Web and API path: users → DNS → GLB Director (L4) → HAProxy (L7) → Rails app → authorization service, Memcached, MySQL. Writes also go into a webhook queue, and workers send them to external receivers. The MySQL primary and two replicas are on the East Coast, two more replicas on the West Coast; replication is asynchronous. orchestrator promotes a replica when the primary is unreachable. On 2018-10-21 at 22:52 UTC, maintenance to replace optical equipment cut the East Coast data center off from the network hub for 43 seconds. orchestrator promoted a West Coast replica. The East Coast primary had a few seconds of writes not yet replicated to the West Coast (954 in one busy cluster), so it could not fail back safely. After the network came back, every write from the East Coast apps crossed the country; pages were slow and the service was degraded for 24 hours 11 minutes. Sources: https://github.blog/news-insights/company-news/oct21-post-incident-analysis/ , https://github.blog/engineering/infrastructure/glb-director-open-source-load-balancer/ , https://github.blog/engineering/infrastructure/mitigating-replication-lag-and-reducing-read-load-with-freno/ , https://github.blog/engineering/infrastructure/stretching-spokes/ . Parameters are small values for teaching.",
