  "背景工人。從前面的 queue 拿訊息來處理，可以再呼叫 DB 或 object storage。它的速度決定 queue 會不會越積越多。": "Background worker. It takes messages from the queue in front of it and can call the DB or object storage in turn. Its speed decides whether the queue keeps piling up.",
