  "逾時的呼叫被重試；重試讓排隊更長、更多呼叫逾時，又產生更多重試。這是正回饋。": "Calls that time out are retried. Retries make the queues longer, so more calls time out, and that makes more retries. This is a positive feedback loop.",
  "逾時順序錯：{caller} 等 {upS} 秒就放棄，函式的 timeout 是 {downS} 秒；使用者已經失敗，函式還在做白工。": "Timeouts in the wrong order: {caller} gives up after {upS} s, but the function timeout is {downS} s; the user has already failed while the function keeps working.",
