  "重試在突波時堆起來了，但沒有多到讓系統一直卡住：排隊慢慢消化完才恢復。": "Retries piled up during the spike, but not enough to keep the system stuck: it recovered after the queues slowly drained.",
  "重試層層相乘：{formula} = 每則最多 {total} 次嘗試。": "Retries multiply across layers: {formula} = up to {total} attempts per message.",
